 height="32" loading="lazy" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-70 grayscale" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li><li class="shrink-0" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/markets/whylist-logo-cscs.png" alt="" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-70 grayscale" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li><li class="shrink-0" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/markets/whylist-logo-meristem.png" alt="" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-70 grayscale" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li><li class="shrink-0" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/markets/whylist-logo-cardinalstone.png" alt="" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-70 grayscale" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li><li class="shrink-0" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/markets/whylist-logo-fbn.webp" alt="" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-70 grayscale" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li><li class="shrink-0" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/markets/whylist-logo-coronation.webp" alt="" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-70 grayscale" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li><li class="shrink-0" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/markets/whylist-logo-cscs.png" alt="" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-70 grayscale" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li><li class="shrink-0" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/markets/whylist-logo-meristem.png" alt="" width="120" height="32" loading="lazy" class="h-8 w-auto opacity-70 grayscale" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li></ul></div></section><!-- Why Companies Choose NASD --><section class="bg-neutral-50 py-20 sm:py-24" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Why Companies Choose NASD</h2><p class="mt-4 text-base text-neutral-700 sm:text-lg" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>We provide structured access to capital while supporting long-term growth.</p></div><ul class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><li class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><span class="inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white text-nasd-red-500 ring-1 ring-neutral-200" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-6" role="img" aria-label="Access to capital"><path fill="currentColor" d="M18.75 1a4.75 4.75 0 0 1 4.75 4.75v.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-.5a3.25 3.25 0 0 0-6.5 0V8h1.25A3.25 3.25 0 0 1 20 11.25v7.5A3.25 3.25 0 0 1 16.75 22h-9.5A3.25 3.25 0 0 1 4 18.75v-7.5A3.25 3.25 0 0 1 7.25 8H14V5.75A4.75 4.75 0 0 1 18.75 1M7.25 9.5a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-1.75 1.75v7.5c0 .966.784 1.75 1.75 1.75h9.5a1.75 1.75 0 0 0 1.75-1.75v-7.5a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-1.75-1.75zM12 13.75a1.25 1.25 0 1 1 0 2.5a1.25 1.25 0 0 1 0-2.5"/></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Access to Capital</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Raise equity or debt from a broad base of investors.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><span class="inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white text-nasd-red-500 ring-1 ring-neutral-200" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-6" role="img" aria-label="Market visibility" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><circle cx="6.5" cy="14.5" r="3.5" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="14.5" r="3.5" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></circle><path d="M10 13.2c.6-1 3.4-1 4 0" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></path><path d="M3.4 12.8 6 6.5" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></path><path d="M20.6 12.8 18 6.5" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Market Visibility</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Enhance credibility, transparency, and investor confidence.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><span class="inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white text-nasd-red-500 ring-1 ring-neutral-200" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-6" role="img" aria-label="Flexible pathways" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><circle cx="6.5" cy="17.5" r="2.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="2.6" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></circle><path d="M8.5 15.5 15.5 8.5" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Flexible Pathways</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Multiple markets designed for companies at different stages.</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><span class="inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white text-nasd-red-500 ring-1 ring-neutral-200" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-6" role="img" aria-label="Regulatory structure"><path fill="currentColor" d="M6.25 3.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75V20.5h2v-2.75c0-.69.56-1.25 1.25-1.25h6.5c.69 0 1.25.56 1.25 1.25v2.75h2v-8.75a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75h-2a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-6a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75zM9 18v2.5h2.25V18zm3.75 0v2.5H15V18zm6.5 4H4.75a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-17A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 6.25 2h8a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 2.25V9.5h1.25A2.25 2.25 