data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><script type="module">var e=document.querySelector(`[data-market-tabs]`),t=document.querySelectorAll(`[data-market-panel]`);e&&e.addEventListener(`click`,n=>{let r=n.target.closest(`[data-market-tab]`);if(!r)return;let i=r.getAttribute(`data-market-tab`);e.querySelectorAll(`[data-market-tab]`).forEach(e=>e.setAttribute(`aria-selected`,e===r?`true`:`false`)),t.forEach(e=>e.classList.toggle(`hidden`,e.getAttribute(`data-market-panel`)!==i))});</script><!-- Your Path to Admission --><section class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-24" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Your Path to Admission</h2><p class="mt-4 text-base text-neutral-700 sm:text-lg" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>While each market has specific requirements, the journey follows a clear structure.</p></div><ol class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-3" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><li class="text-center" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><span class="mx-auto inline-flex size-24 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-nasd-red-500" style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #FCE9E9, #FBF2F2)" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-9" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8 5.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0 5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5M4 8a4 4 0 1 1 8 0a4 4 0 0 1-8 0m13-.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3M14 9a3 3 0 1 1 6 0a3 3 0 0 1-6 0m-1.223 5.248A2.24 2.24 0 0 0 11.75 14h-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2 16.25v.278a2 2 0 0 0 .014.208a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 .778 2.07C3.61 19.974 5.172 21 8 21c1.608 0 2.807-.332 3.692-.833l-1.117-1.117c-.618.267-1.45.45-2.575.45c-2.422 0-3.486-.85-3.98-1.555a3 3 0 0 1-.513-1.358l-.007-.08v-.257a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h7.275zm7.504.472a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06L20.438 17H13.56l1.219-1.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06-1.06l-2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.06l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06-1.06l-1.22-1.22h6.88l-1.22 1.22a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.06l2.5-2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.06z"/></svg></span><p class="mt-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-500" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Step 1</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Initial Consultation</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Engage with NASD to assess your company&#39;s structure, objectives, and capital needs, and determine the most suitable market for admission.</p></li><li class="text-center" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><span class="mx-auto inline-flex size-24 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-nasd-red-500" style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #FCE9E9, #FBF2F2)" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-9" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M5.503 4.627L5.5 6.75v10.504a3.25 3.25 0 0 0 3.25 3.25h8.616a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.122 1.5H8.75A4.75 4.75 0 0 1 4 17.254V6.75c0-.98.627-1.815 1.503-2.123M13.128 2c.597 0 1.17.237 1.592.66l4.618 4.62c.422.422.659.995.659 1.591v8.383a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H8.752a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V4.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 8.752 2zM13 3.5H8.752a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75v13.004c0 .414.336.75.75.75h8.995a.75.75 0 0 0 .75-.75V9.003H15.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.245-2.095L13 6.754zm1.5 1.061l.001 2.193c0 .38.282.693.648.743l.102.007l2.19-.001z"/></svg></span><p class="mt-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-500" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Step 2</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Documentation &amp; Review</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Submit all required documentation for regulatory review and compliance assessment, ensuring your application meets NASD&#39;s requirements.</p></li><li class="text-center" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><span class="mx-auto inline-flex size-24 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-nasd-red-500" style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #FCE9E9, #FBF2F2)" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-9" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12S6.477 2 12 2m0 1.5a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 0 17a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-17m-1.25 9.94l4.47-4.47a.75.75 0 0 1 1.133.976l-.073.084l-5 5a.75.75 0 0 1-.976.073l-.084-.073l-2.5-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 .976-1.133l.084.073zl4.47-4.47z"/></svg></span><p class="mt-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-500" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Step 3</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Approval &amp; Admission</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Complete the onboarding process, fulfil all regulatory requirements, and proceed to trading or issuing securities on the NASD market.</p></li></ol><div class="mt-12 flex justify-center" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/REQUIREMENTS-FOR-THE-ADMISSION-OF-COMPANIES-ON-NASD-2025.updated.pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-nasd-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>View Detailed Admission Guidelines<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-4" role="img" aria-label="Go"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.837 3.13a.5.5 0 0 0-.674.74L16.33 9.5H2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1h13.828l-6.165 5.628a.5.5 0 0 0 .674.739l6.916-6.314a.747.747 0 0 0 0-1.108z"/></svg></a></div></div></section><!-- We Partner With You Beyond Listing --><section class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-24" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="max-w-3xl" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>We Partner With You Beyond Listing</h2><p class="mt-4 text-base text-neutral-700 sm:text-lg" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Our relationship does not end at admission. We provide ongoing market support, compliance guidance, and visibility opportunities to help your company grow.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:gap-16" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><!-- 4 photo cards in 2x2 --><ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><li class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/companies/partner-headset.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square size-full object-cover" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li><li class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/companies/partner-support.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square size-full object-cover" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li><li class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/companies/partner-data.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square size-full object-cover" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li><li class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/companies/partner-advisor.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square size-full object-cover" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></li></ul><!-- 4 text items with inline red icons --><ul class="space-y-8" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><li data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="flex items-center gap-3" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-6 shrink-0 text-nasd-red-500" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M17.212 2.237a.75.75 0 0 0-1.423-.474l-.75 2.249a.75.75 0 0 0 1.423.474zm4.568-.017a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06-1.06l2.5-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0M9.076 4.318a2.325 2.325 0 0 1 3.795-.577l7.006 7.506a2.325 2.325 0 0 1-.758 3.712l-3.42 1.516a4 4 0 0 1-7.314 3.24l-1.417.628a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.964-.336L3.565 18.65a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-.387-2.091zm.682 14.789a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4.569-2.024zm2.016-14.342a.825.825 0 0 0-1.346.204L4.53 17.21a.3.3 0 0 0 .064.349l1.439 1.356a.3.3 0 0 0 .327.056l12.151-5.383a.825.825 0 0 0 .27-1.317zM19 8.249a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h2a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75"/></svg><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Corporate action support</h3></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Support for dividends, rights issues, restructures, and other corporate actions to ensure smooth execution.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="flex items-center gap-3" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-6 shrink-0 text-nasd-red-500" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 9.005a4 4 0 1 1 0 8a4 4 0 0 1 0-8m0 1.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0 5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5M12 5.5c4.613 0 8.596 3.15 9.701 7.564a.75.75 0 1 1-1.455.365a8.504 8.504 0 0 0-16.493.004a.75.75 0 0 1-1.456-.363A10 10 0 0 1 12 5.5"/></svg><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Market visibility</h3></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Greater exposure through announcements, data distribution, and investor-facing channels.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="flex items-center gap-3" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-6 shrink-0 text-nasd-red-500" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8 5.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0 5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5M4 8a4 4 0 1 1 8 0a4 4 0 0 1-8 0m13-.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3M14 9a3 3 0 1 1 6 0a3 3 0 0 1-6 0m-1.223 5.248A2.24 2.24 0 0 0 11.75 14h-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2 16.25v.278a2 2 0 0 0 .014.208a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 .778 2.07C3.61 19.974 5.172 21 8 21c1.608 0 2.807-.332 3.692-.833l-1.117-1.117c-.618.267-1.45.45-2.575.45c-2.422 0-3.486-.85-3.98-1.555a3 3 0 0 1-.513-1.358l-.007-.08v-.257a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h7.275zm7.504.472a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06L20.438 17H13.56l1.219-1.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06-1.06l-2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.06l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06-1.06l-1.22-1.22h6.88l-1.22 1.22a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.06l2.5-2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.06z"/></svg><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Investor engagement</h3></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Structured opportunities to connect with current and potential investors.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="flex items-center gap-3" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-6 shrink-0 text-nasd-red-500" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.75 2a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.236 2.002V4h1.764A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 20 6.25v5.248a6.5 6.5 0 0 0-1.5-.422V6.25a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75h-2.129c-.404.603-1.091 1-1.871 1h-3.5c-.78 0-1.467-.397-1.871-1H6.25a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75v13.5c0 .414.336.75.75.75h5.482A6.5 6.5 0 0 0 12.81 22H6.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4 19.75V6.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 6.25 4h1.764a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.236-2zm2.245 2.096L16 4.25q0-.078-.005-.154M13.75 3.5h-3.5a.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.5h3.5a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.5m9.25 14a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-11 0a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0m-2.146-2.354a.5.5 0 0 0-.708 0L16.5 18.793l-1.646-1.647a.5.5 0 0 0-.708.708l2 2a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708"/></svg><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Ongoing compliance guidance</h3></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Continued guidance to help you meet regulatory requirements and maintain good standing.</p></li></ul></div></div></section><!-- FAQs --><div id="faqs" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><section class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl">FAQs</h2><p class="mt-3 text-base text-neutral-700 sm:text-lg">Some of the commonly asked questions you may have about equity admission process.</p></div><ul class="mt-10 divide-y divide-neutral-200 border-y border-neutral-200"><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>Why should my company list on NASD?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">NASD gives you access to capital, improves visibility, and supports long-term growth.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>What types of companies can list on NASD?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Companies across different sectors can list, as long as they meet the listing requirements.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>How does listing on NASD help my business grow?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Listing helps you raise funds, build trust, and attract new investors.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>What are the key benefits of choosing NASD?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">You get access to a regulated market, flexible listing options, and investor access.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>How is NASD different from other exchanges?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">NASD focuses on over-the-counter trading and offers simpler entry requirements for companies compared to other exchanges.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>Can small or growing companies list on NASD?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Yes. NASD supports growth-stage companies, not just large firms. As long as your company is a public limited liability company and meets the listing requirements, it can be listed on NASD..</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>Will my company gain visibility after listing?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Yes. Listed companies gain more exposure to investors and the public, and they are added to the OTC Market.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>What support does NASD provide to listed companies?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">We provide guidance through the listing process and ongoing market support.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>What are the requirements to get listed?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Requirements depend on the type of listing. Details are provided in the listing guidelines.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>How do I start the listing process?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">You can begin by contacting NASD or speaking with an approved market operator or advisor.</div></details></li></ul></div></section></div><!-- Closing CTA with photo background --><section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-nasd-blue-900 py-20 text-white sm:py-28" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><img src="/marketing/markets/cta-phone.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="1440" height="575" loading="lazy" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 size-full object-cover object-[center_42%]" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-nasd-blue-900/40" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Ready to Take the Next Step?</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base text-white/90 sm:text-lg" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Speak with our team to explore the right market for your company.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2><a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-nasd-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white ring-1 ring-white/25 transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-nasd-blue-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Speak with our team</a><a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/REQUIREMENTS-FOR-THE-ADMISSION-OF-COMPANIES-ON-NASD-2025.updated.pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-nasd-blue-900 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-nasd-blue-900" data-astro-cid-qub7vzj2>Download Guidelines Overview</a></div></div></div></section></main><section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="newsletter-heading"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><h2 id="newsletter-heading" class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-5xl">Join our newsletter</h2><p class="mt-3 text-base text-neutral-700 sm:text-lg">Stay informed with the latest market updates, insights, and announcements from NASD.</p><form data-newsletter-form action="/api/newsletter" method="post" novalidate class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-stretch gap-3 sm:mx-auto sm:max-w-xl sm:flex-row"><label for="newsletter-email" class="sr-only">Email address</label><input id="newsletter-email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Enter email" data-newsletter-email class="w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 focus:border-nasd-blue-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-nasd-blue-600/30 sm:flex-1"><!-- Honeypot: hidden from users; bots that fill it are silently dropped. --><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-[-9999px] h-0 w-0 overflow-hidden"><label>Company<input type="text" name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><button type="submit" data-newsletter-submit class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-nasd-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60"><span data-newsletter-label>Join our newsletter</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-4" role="img" aria-label="Submit"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.837 3.13a.5.5 0 0 0-.674.74L16.33 9.5H2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1h13.828l-6.165 5.628a.5.5 0 0 0 .674.739l6.916-6.314a.747.747 0 0 0 0-1.108z"/></svg></button></form><!-- Turnstile renders here once the script lazy-loads (on first focus). --><div data-turnstile data-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAEV4dakQgTkdy09O" data-action="newsletter" class="mt-4 flex min-h-[65px] justify-center sm:mx-auto sm:max-w-xl [&amp;:empty]:min-h-0"></div><p data-newsletter-status role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mt-3 text-sm"></p></div></section><script type="module">document.querySelectorAll(`[data-newsletter-form]`).forEach(e=>{let t=e.querySelector(`[data-newsletter-email]`),n=e.querySelector(`[data-newsletter-submit]`),r=e.querySelector(`[data-newsletter-label]`),i=e.closest(`section`),a=i.querySelector(`[data-turnstile]`),o=i.querySelector(`[data-newsletter-status]`),s,c=!1;function l(e,t){o.textContent=e,o.className=`mt-3 text-sm ${t?`text-success-700`:`text-nasd-red-700`}`}function u(){if(c||s!==void 0)return;c=!0;let e=()=>{let e=window.turnstile;e&&(s=e.render(a,{sitekey:a.dataset.sitekey,action:a.dataset.action,appearance:`interaction-only`}))};if(window.turnstile){e();return}let t=document.createElement(`script`);t.src=`https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js?render=explicit`,t.async=!0,t.defer=!0,t.onload=e,document.head.appendChild(t)}t.addEventListener(`focus`,u,{once:!0});function d(){let t=e.querySelector(`[name="cf-turnstile-response"]`);if(t?.value)return t.value;let n=window.turnstile;return s!==void 0&&n?n.getResponse(s)??``:``}e.addEventListener(`submit`,async i=>{i.preventDefault();let a=t.value.trim();if(!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(a)||a.length>254){l(`Please enter a valid email address.`,!1),t.focus();return}u();let o=d();if(!o){l(`Please complete the verification, then try again.`,!1);return}n.disabled=!0,r.textContent=`Subscribing…`;try{let t=await fetch(`/api/newsletter`,{method:`POST`,headers:{"content-type":`application/json`},body:JSON.stringify({email:a,token:o,company:``})}),n=await t.json().catch(()=>({}));l(n.message??(t.ok?`Thanks for subscribing.`:`Something went wrong.`),!!n.ok),n.ok&&e.reset()}catch{l(`Network error. Please try again.`,!1)}finally{let e=window.turnstile;s!==void 0&&e&&e.reset(s),n.disabled=!1,r.textContent=`Join our newsletter`}})});</script><footer class="border-t border-neutral-200 bg-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><!-- 5-column grid: brand + 4 nav columns --><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5"><!-- Column 1: brand block --><div class="space-y-5"><a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center " aria-label="NASD PLC home"><img src="/logos/NASD-PLC-1-1.png" alt="NASD PLC" class="w-auto h-8" width="320" height="80" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">The NASD OTC Securities Exchange is an Over The Counter (OTC) market and a Self-Regulatory Organisation, registered with and regulated by the Securities and Exchange Commission, Nigeria. NASD is also a member of the Association of Securities Exchanges of Africa (ASEA), the Lagos Chamber of Commerce and Industry (LCCI), and the Association of Securities Exchanges of Nigeria (ASEN).</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/get-started" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-nasd-blue-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2">Get Started</a><!--
            NASD: "Live Market links to the OTC Market Watch page not the
            admitted securities page." It pointed at /markets/admitted
            (Admitted Securities); OTC Market Watch is /markets/statistics.

            Get Started above stays on /get-started deliberately: that page
            offers both routes — "Raise capital on NASD" and "Open an account
            and invest" — which suits a footer button serving both audiences,
            where /investors/get-started is investor-only.
          --><a href="/markets/statistics" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2">Live Market</a></div></div><!-- Column 2: Markets --><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Markets</h3><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li><a href="/markets/admitted" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Admitted Companies</a></li><li><a href="/markets/introduce" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Introduce a Company</a></li><li><a href="/markets/watchlist" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Watchlist</a></li><li><a href="/markets/delisted" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Delisted &amp; Suspended Companies</a></li><li><a href="/markets/commercial-paper" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Commercial Paper</a></li><li><a href="/markets/bonds" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Bonds</a></li><li><a href="/markets/indices" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Indices</a></li><li><a href="/markets/price-list" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Price List</a></li><li><a href="/markets/reports" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Trade Reports</a></li><li><a href="/markets/data-portal" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">NASD Data Portal Services</a></li><li><a href="/markets/api" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">API Access</a></li><li><a href="/markets/rules" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Market Rules</a></li><li><a href="/markets/regulation" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Issuer Regulation</a></li><li><a href="/markets/documents" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Document Library (Forms)</a></li><li><a href="/markets/operator" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Become a market operator</a></li><li><a href="/markets/members" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Members &amp; Partners List</a></li></ul></div><!-- Column 3: Companies + Investors --><div class="space-y-8"><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Companies</h3><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li><a href="/companies/why-list" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Why List / Join NASD</a></li><li><a href="/companies/equities" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Equities Admission process steps</a></li><li><a href="/companies/debt" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Debt Admission process steps</a></li><li><a href="/companies/private" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Private Market Admission process steps</a></li><li><a href="/companies/nasdep" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">NASDeP Admission steps</a></li><li><a href="/companies/n-dsp" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">N-DSP Admission process</a></li><li><a href="/companies/faqs" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">FAQs (Companies)</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Investors</h3><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li><a href="/investors/get-started" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">How to Invest / Get Started</a></li><li><a href="/investors/brokers" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Find a Broker</a></li><li><a href="/investors/fees" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Fees &amp; Trading Hours</a></li><li><a href="/investors/faqs" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">FAQs (Investors)</a></li></ul></div></div><!-- Column 4: Products + Resources --><div class="space-y-8"><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Products</h3><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li><a href="/products/otc" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">NASD OTC Exchange</a></li><li><a href="/products/private-market" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Private Market</a></li><li><a href="/products/nasdep" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">NASDeP</a></l